      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-440-517"><seg source="#source-440-517">目ガアツテ居ナケレバナラナイ筈ノ場所ニハ森林デアル</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-517-543"><seg source="#source-517-543">笑ヒガ在ツテ居タ</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-543-602" style="padding-inline-start: 4em">
