          <head n="2" source="#source-564-600"><seg source="#source-564-567">２</seg></head>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-602-610"><seg source="#source-602-610">人参</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-610-669" style="padding-inline-start: 4em">
        <div>
          <head n="2" source="#source-631-667"><seg source="#source-631-634">３</seg></head>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-669-740"><seg source="#source-669-740">あめりかノ幽霊ハ水族館デアルガ非常ニ流麗デアル</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-740-826"><seg source="#source-740-755">ソレハ陰欝</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-761-806"><seg source="#source-755-761">デデ</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-785-791">ママ</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-806-826">モァルコトダ</seg></p>
      </div>
