      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-1310-1342"><seg source="#source-1310-1342">粟ヲツメタめりけん袋</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-1342-1380"><seg source="#source-1342-1380">簡単ナ須臾ノ月夜デアツタ</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1380-1439" style="padding-inline-start: 4em">
